Below is the exact request you would send to VirusTotal V3 to pull the **sub‑domain** relationships for `example.org`.  
Only the related object IDs (and any context attributes that VirusTotal returns) are shown – no other fields are included.

---

### API Call

```
GET https://www.virustotal.com/api/v3/objects/domain:example.org/relationships
    ?relationship_type=subdomains
    &limit=10
    &continuation_cursor=abc
```

**Headers**

| Header | Value |
|--------|-------|
| `x-apikey` | `my_api` |
| `Accept` | `application/json` |

---

